  "flavor_text": {
    "one_line": "A field-kingdom culture of sworn duty, communal harvests, and stern local law.",
    "one_paragraph": "Haldoran realms spread across open grainlands where village bells, charter stones, and levy roads bind lord and commoner alike. They value ordered obligation over spectacle, rewarding those who keep oaths, tend the commons, and answer the banner when raiders come. Their nobles are expected to judge openly, their priests to feed the hungry in bad years, and their mages to serve under seal and scrutiny."
